{"fps": 30, "total": 37.417635000000004, "hash": "5653808143b7b6b1", "chapters": [], "beats": [{"id": "b01", "text": "What if everyone on your street could see your salary?", "start": 0.054000000000000006, "end": 1.8739999999999999, "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 0.054000000000000006, "end": 0.214}, {"text": "if", "start": 0.214, "end": 0.294}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 0.294, "end": 0.6140000000000001}, {"text": "on", "start": 0.6140000000000001, "end": 0.8540000000000001}, {"text": "your", "start": 0.8540000000000001, "end": 0.9540000000000001}, {"text": "street", "start": 0.9540000000000001, "end": 1.154}, {"text": "could", "start": 1.154, "end": 1.334}, {"text": "see", "start": 1.334, "end": 1.474}, {"text": "your", "start": 1.474, "end": 1.5739999999999998}, {"text": "salary?", "start": 1.5739999999999998, "end": 1.8739999999999999}]}, {"id": "b02", "text": "Because in Norway they actually can.", "start": 2.4059999999999997, "end": 4.166, "words": [{"text": "Because", "start": 2.4059999999999997, "end": 2.6060000000000003}, {"text": "in", "start": 2.6060000000000003, "end": 2.726}, {"text": "Norway", "start": 2.726, "end": 3.0060000000000002}, {"text": "they", "start": 3.406, "end": 3.506}, {"text": "actually", "start": 3.506, "end": 3.7659999999999996}, {"text": "can.", "start": 3.7659999999999996, "end": 4.166}]}, {"id": "b03", "text": "You type any name into your phone and their income just pops up.", "start": 4.712000000000001, "end": 7.572, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 4.712000000000001, "end": 4.792}, {"text": "type", "start": 4.792, "end": 4.932000000000001}, {"text": "any", "start": 4.932000000000001, "end": 5.192000000000001}, {"text": "name", "start": 5.192000000000001, "end": 5.492000000000001}, {"text": "into", "start": 5.492000000000001, "end": 5.672000000000001}, {"text": "your", "start": 5.672000000000001, "end": 5.832}, {"text": "phone", "start": 5.832, "end": 6.072}, {"text": "and", "start": 6.072, "end": 6.392}, {"text": "their", "start": 6.392, "end": 6.512000000000001}, {"text": "income", "start": 6.512000000000001, "end": 6.732}, {"text": "just", "start": 6.732, "end": 7.072000000000001}, {"text": "pops", "start": 7.072000000000001, "end": 7.292}, {"text": "up.", "start": 7.292, "end": 7.572}]}, {"id": "b04", "text": "So people looked up their boss and their neighbor and even their ex", "start": 7.921, "end": 10.361, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 7.921, "end": 8.041}, {"text": "people", "start": 8.041, "end": 8.181000000000001}, {"text": "looked", "start": 8.181000000000001, "end": 8.421}, {"text": "up", "start": 8.421, "end": 8.541}, {"text": "their", "start": 8.541, "end": 8.721}, {"text": "boss", "start": 8.721, "end": 8.941}, {"text": "and", "start": 8.941, "end": 9.181000000000001}, {"text": "their", "start": 9.181000000000001, "end": 9.301}, {"text": "neighbor", "start": 9.301, "end": 9.541}, {"text": "and", "start": 9.541, "end": 9.781}, {"text": "even", "start": 9.781, "end": 9.981}, {"text": "their", "start": 9.981, "end": 10.141}, {"text": "ex", "start": 10.141, "end": 10.361}]}, {"id": "b05", "text": "sixteen million times in one year in a country of five million people.", "start": 10.906, "end": 14.426000000000002, "words": [{"text": "sixteen", "start": 10.906, "end": 11.266}, {"text": "million", "start": 11.266, "end": 11.586}, {"text": "times", "start": 11.586, "end": 12.026}, {"text": "in", "start": 12.026, "end": 12.306000000000001}, {"text": "one", "start": 12.306000000000001, "end": 12.466000000000001}, {"text": "year", "start": 12.466000000000001, "end": 12.706}, {"text": "in", "start": 12.706, "end": 12.946}, {"text": "a", "start": 12.946, "end": 13.026}, {"text": "country", "start": 13.026, "end": 13.266}, {"text": "of", "start": 13.266, "end": 13.486}, {"text": "five", "start": 13.486, "end": 13.766}, {"text": "million", "start": 13.766, "end": 14.026}, {"text": "people.", "start": 14.026, "end": 14.426000000000002}]}, {"id": "b06", "text": "But then scientists measured how happy everyone was", "start": 14.836000000000002, "end": 17.096, "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 14.836000000000002, "end": 14.956}, {"text": "then", "start": 14.956, "end": 15.116}, {"text": "scientists", "start": 15.116, "end": 15.516}, {"text": "measured", "start": 15.516, "end": 15.896}, {"text": "how", "start": 15.896, "end": 16.136}, {"text": "happy", "start": 16.136, "end": 16.456}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 16.456, "end": 16.796}, {"text": "was", "start": 16.796, "end": 17.096}]}, {"id": "b07", "text": "and nobody's paycheck changed yet the rich got happier and the poor got sadder.", "start": 17.515, "end": 21.235, "words": [{"text": "and", "start": 17.515, "end": 17.634999999999998}, {"text": "nobody's", "start": 17.634999999999998, "end": 18.035}, {"text": "paycheck", "start": 18.035, "end": 18.195}, {"text": "changed", "start": 18.195, "end": 18.874999999999996}, {"text": "yet", "start": 19.215, "end": 19.375}, {"text": "the", "start": 19.375, "end": 19.494999999999997}, {"text": "rich", "start": 19.494999999999997, "end": 19.634999999999998}, {"text": "got", "start": 19.634999999999998, "end": 19.794999999999998}, {"text": "happier", "start": 19.794999999999998, "end": 20.134999999999998}, {"text": "and", "start": 20.134999999999998, "end": 20.415}, {"text": "the", "start": 20.415, "end": 20.495}, {"text": "poor", "start": 20.495, "end": 20.654999999999998}, {"text": "got", "start": 20.654999999999998, "end": 20.855}, {"text": "sadder.", "start": 20.855, "end": 21.235}]}, {"id": "b08", "text": "So Norway changed one tiny rule.", "start": 21.742600000000003, "end": 23.5226, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 21.742600000000003, "end": 21.9626}, {"text": "Norway", "start": 22.2226, "end": 22.4026}, {"text": "changed", "start": 22.4026, "end": 22.722600000000003}, {"text": "one", "start": 22.722600000000003, "end": 23.0026}, {"text": "tiny", "start": 23.0026, "end": 23.2626}, {"text": "rule.", "start": 23.2626, "end": 23.5226}]}, {"id": "b09", "text": "Now when you look someone up they can see your name.", "start": 24.0076, "end": 26.1476, "words": [{"text": "Now", "start": 24.0076, "end": 24.207600000000003}, {"text": "when", "start": 24.207600000000003, "end": 24.3876}, {"text": "you", "start": 24.3876, "end": 24.487600000000004}, {"text": "look", "start": 24.487600000000004, "end": 24.647600000000004}, {"text": "someone", "start": 24.647600000000004, "end": 24.8476}, {"text": "up", "start": 24.8476, "end": 25.147600000000004}, {"text": "they", "start": 25.3476, "end": 25.467600000000004}, {"text": "can", "start": 25.467600000000004, "end": 25.6476}, {"text": "see", "start": 25.6476, "end": 25.8076}, {"text": "your", "start": 25.8076, "end": 25.947599999999998}, {"text": "name.", "start": 25.947599999999998, "end": 26.1476}]}, {"id": "b10", "text": "And the searches crashed from sixteen million to two million.", "start": 26.7226, "end": 29.302599999999998, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 26.7226, "end": 26.802599999999998}, {"text": "the", "start": 26.802599999999998, "end": 26.882600000000004}, {"text": "searches", "start": 26.882600000000004, "end": 27.0626}, {"text": "crashed", "start": 27.0626, "end": 27.3826}, {"text": "from", "start": 27.3826, "end": 27.7426}, {"text": "sixteen", "start": 27.7426, "end": 28.0626}, {"text": "million", "start": 28.0626, "end": 28.4026}, {"text": "to", "start": 28.4026, "end": 28.8226}, {"text": "two", "start": 28.8226, "end": 29.0026}, {"text": "million.", "start": 29.0026, "end": 29.302599999999998}]}, {"id": "b11", "text": "Because people never wanted to know the number.", "start": 29.8796, "end": 32.0196, "words": [{"text": "Because", "start": 29.8796, "end": 30.1396}, {"text": "people", "start": 30.1396, "end": 30.5396}, {"text": "never", "start": 30.5396, "end": 30.879600000000003}, {"text": "wanted", "start": 30.879600000000003, "end": 31.179600000000004}, {"text": "to", "start": 31.179600000000004, "end": 31.399600000000003}, {"text": "know", "start": 31.399600000000003, "end": 31.5796}, {"text": "the", "start": 31.5796, "end": 31.7396}, {"text": "number.", "start": 31.7396, "end": 32.0196}]}, {"id": "b12", "text": "They just wanted to look without getting caught.", "start": 32.6526, "end": 34.2526, "words": [{"text": "They", "start": 32.6526, "end": 32.7526}, {"text": "just", "start": 32.7526, "end": 32.9126}, {"text": "wanted", "start": 32.9126, "end": 33.1526}, {"text": "to", "start": 33.1526, "end": 33.3526}, {"text": "look", "start": 33.3526, "end": 33.492599999999996}, {"text": "without", "start": 33.492599999999996, "end": 33.7326}, {"text": "getting", "start": 33.7326, "end": 33.9726}, {"text": "caught.", "start": 33.9726, "end": 34.2526}]}, {"id": "b13", "text": "So next time you wonder what your neighbor makes just ask yourself", "start": 34.7406, "end": 37.0406, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 34.7406, "end": 34.820600000000006}, {"text": "next", "start": 34.820600000000006, "end": 34.9806}, {"text": "time", "start": 34.9806, "end": 35.2206}, {"text": "you", "start": 35.2206, "end": 35.3406}, {"text": "wonder", "start": 35.3406, "end": 35.5006}, {"text": "what", "start": 35.5006, "end": 35.7606}, {"text": "your", "start": 35.7606, "end": 35.860600000000005}, {"text": "neighbor", "start": 35.860600000000005, "end": 36.0606}, {"text": "makes", "start": 36.0606, "end": 36.3406}, {"text": "just", "start": 36.52060000000001, "end": 36.6006}, {"text": "ask", "start": 36.6006, "end": 36.7606}, {"text": "yourself", "start": 36.7606, "end": 37.0406}]}], "gaps": [], "maxgap": 0.3, "tempo": 1.08}